    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Spratt in conjunction with Barry Murphy Auctioneers on the instructions of the Executors offer for sale by Public Auction a substantial two storey detached farmhouse on Friday 30th October at 3pm in the Newpark Hotel, Kilkenny. This residence stands on a 9.1 acre holding laid out in one large field all in permanent pasture with well defined mature hedgerows. This truthfully offers a rare opportunity to acquire a residentail holding located only 3.8km south of the Kilkenny City Ring Road and 8.2km north of Kells Village.\n\nThis substantial dwelling 140sq.m (internal measurement) is in need of complete refurbishment and also having adjacent some cut stone out offices. This dwelling potentially qualifies for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant (https://www.gov.ie/en/department-of-housing-local-government-and-heritage/services/vacant-property-refurbishment-grant/). \n\nIf you are looking for an opportunity to construct a dream home surrounded by your own land for hobby farm purposes, equine purposes or just to guarantee privacy, this opportunity could be for you!\n\nNote on the day of the auction the property shall offered for sale in three lots.\n\nLot 1 (Map A) - The dwelling standing on c.9 acres.\nLot 2 (Map B) - c.71 acres.\nLot 3 (Map C) - The entire c.80 acres.\n\nMaps and further details from Joint Selling Agents, REA Spratt 058-42211 and Barry Murphy Auctioneers 051-858444."
      },
